/-!
# The literal block labels of the degree-2080 action

The 65 blocks, in the lexicographic order of `source/blocks.json`, partition
all 2080 points. `blockOf` gives their zero-based labels and `representative`
chooses the least point of each block. Their section identity and compatibility
with the two generators and central involutions are checked by Lean's kernel.
The original numerical data and action conventions are attributed in
`AtlasModel/source/README.md`. No group order is inferred from these tables.
-/

